// dsl/extdeps/test/mock_corpus.dag
// Scope: the REST http_pilot layer's PUBLISHED mock corpus as a closed structural fact.
// Anchor: DESIGN.md §3 (single authority) / §6 (model-just-in-time, mark the carrier).
//
// SINGLE authority for WHICH http_pilot operations are hermetically realizable. Read by BOTH the
// compile-time M2 mock_totality_lens (src/v2/lens/mock_totality.dag) AND the v1 runtime's
// eval_service_call (the M4 hermetic-realization fold) — one model, not two. The v1 runtime loads
// the dsl/ tree, so this corpus must live in dsl/ for the runtime to reach the SAME model the lens
// reads; the v2 mirror (src/v2/extdeps/test/mock_corpus.dag) is dissolved by this PR. The v2
// lens imports this dsl module directly — cross-tree v2->dsl import is the EXISTING pattern (cf.
// filesystem / git / shell mock corpora).
//
// Rows inhabit std.hermetic_replay.PublishedMockCase. The operation set authority remains
// dsl/extdeps/test/http_pilot.dag (`service test.HttpPilot`); per-case payloads live in the
// Phase-2 RecordedFixture store ONLY — rows carry the (operation_key, case_id) structural key.

module extdeps.test.mock_corpus

import std.hermetic_replay { PublishedMockCase }

data http_pilot_mock_case_get_post: PublishedMockCase = PublishedMockCase {
  operation_key: "test.HttpPilot.GetPost",
  service: "test.HttpPilot",
  operation: "GetPost",
  case_id: 0
}

// 🟡 gated — feature:http-pilot-mock-corpus-from-service-decl — bind node://adhoc-3dfa917b-5f9
// dissolve-on-arrival: project this corpus directly from the `service test.HttpPilot` operation set
// in dsl/extdeps/test/http_pilot.dag, joined with the Phase-2 RecordedFixture store (the authority
// for WHICH recorded cases exist per operation), once a v2 lens can read a service decl's operation
// nodes and the fixture store's keys; this declared list then deletes in the same PR. forbidden: a
// row carrying a response VALUE — that would fork the payload authority, now owned by the fixture
// store (§3); rows mirror the (operation_key, case_id) structural key ONLY.
data http_pilot_published_mock_corpus: List<PublishedMockCase> = [
  http_pilot_mock_case_get_post
]
